{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_013K3JLR4qL1NifecYBQ6ENo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The verify gate passed (exit 0). Critically, I've confirmed the PI types: `MessageEndEvent` carries **only** `{ message: AgentMessage }` — no durable per-message entry id (verified PI v0.79.2 surface). So synthesizing a position counter `s<N>` is the only available anchor, and the SV-001 fix (seeding it from the durable `inspect.overview` count) is the correct, robust solution: new keys `s<E>, s<E+1>…` provably never collide with prior `s0…s<K-1>` since event-count E ≥ hook-call-count K. Let me read the gate output and the remaining capture tests to confirm full AC/TC coverage and that tests assert on real recorded state."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":297,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13203,"cache_read_input_tokens":125010,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13203},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24167eda-1813-43e8-bfbc-fbb2eb03ffb4","uuid":"e8c04286-7db5-4db3-ae7c-15bef1c27b32","request_id":"req_011Cc2p9pVAv4tFN4gTKXPzo"}
